       ros2 pkg list | grep cyclone
       ros2 pkg list | grep zenoh

6. ROS domain isolation working?
       RMW_IMPLEMENTATION=rmw_cyclonedds_cpp ROS_DOMAIN_ID=10 ros2 topic list
       RMW_IMPLEMENTATION=rmw_zenoh_cpp ROS_DOMAIN_ID=4 ros2 topic list

7. Topics visible on correct domain?
       ROS_DOMAIN_ID=10 ros2 topic echo /drone_a/cmd_vel
       ROS_DOMAIN_ID=4  ros2 topic echo /drone_b/cmd_vel


================================================================================
PART 8 — COMMON PITFALLS
================================================================================

  PROBLEM                           | CAUSE                            | FIX
  ----------------------------------|----------------------------------|---------------------------
  Both drones on same topic         | Same ROS_DOMAIN_ID               | Tello=10, Astro=4
  Astro not reachable               | Wrong ASTRO_NUM or ZENOH config  | Check ZENOH_CONFIG_OVERRIDE
  Tello commands go to wrong iface  | CycloneDDS picked wrong route    | Check routing table (Part 4)
  USB Wi-Fi drops connection        | Power management                 | sudo iwconfig drone_b power off
  drone_a IP changed after reboot   | Short DHCP lease (~1hr)          | Reserve IP in Tello DHCP
  Zenoh connection refused          | Astro not reachable on 8.24:7447 | Ping 192.168.8.24 first
  ROS nodes can't find each other   | Wrong RMW_IMPLEMENTATION set     | Double-check env vars


